# Breezy Does It (levels/solo/breezy.txt), the no-call route. The same start; at the fork call
# nothing and drop past the canal into the tunnel: hop the spikes, toot over the crumbling pit
# into the hurdle's headwind. Under the last island the secret: a fan in the floor blows up a
# slot; stop in it (let go of Right), float up into the nook, and there's Han behind a grate
# ("Nat?!"). Drop out through the hole, on under the bank (another crumbling pit, the low crawl
# into the wind, the hurdle), up the fan and the crumbling ledge to the bank. The nerve fork:
# the spiky low line, little hops from crumbling stone to stone under the ceiling spikes. The
# shout chorus to the plunger: hover in the fan, toot onto the crumbling stone, the vent's
# gust, the climb out (jump off each stone and toot over the next fan).
